# Scene sprites - original pixel art in the SMB3 style (slot 1 = dark outline; characters face RIGHT)
# Toad House chests, Toad, Princess Toadstool (ending), the story's lanterns, and inventory icons.
#
# TWO-PALETTE SPLITS (engine: "split GROUP ROW" -> rows < ROW use GROUP.head, rows >= ROW use GROUP.body):
#   toad.*     S  = 11 : rows 0-10 = cap (toad.head: 1 black, 2 red spots, 3 white cap)
#                        rows 11-23 = face/body (toad.body: 1 black, 2 blue vest, 3 skin; pants use skin as cream)
#   princess.* S2 = 12 : rows 0-11 = crown/hair/face/raised hand (princess.head: 1 black, 2 gold hair, 3 skin)
#                        rows 12-31 = gown + long hair down the back (princess.body: 1 black, 2 gold hair/trim, 3 pink)
#   (toad.2 bobs 1 px down: its row 11 is the black cap rim, valid in either palette.)
#   pal= on these only picks the one-palette `sheet` preview (toad: cap colours, princess: gown colours).
# Chests: palette `chest` (1 black, 2 wood, 3 gold straps/lock). Both frames share the same box (rows 8-15).
# Lanterns: lantern.lit / lantern.dark share palette `lantern` (1 black, 2 gold frame, 3 glow + frame shine);
#   lantern.dark shows the glass as black (slot 1) with a small slot-3 glint; `lantern.glow` = brighter flicker palette.
# Icons (16x16, inventory grid on black): each has its own palette named like the image.
split toad 11
split princess 12
# 16-bit upgrade: 15-colour palettes; each material has a 3-4 step ramp (light top-left), dark hue-tinted outline.
#   toad.head: 1 outline, 2-5 white cap ramp, 6-9 red spot ramp | toad.body: 1 outline, 2-4 skin, 5-8 vest, 9-b pants, c-e shoes, f white
#   princess.head/body: 1 outline, 2-5 gold hair ramp, 6-8 skin, 9 jewel/trim, a-d gown ramp (body)
#   chest: 1 outline, 2-5 wood ramp, 3/6/7 gold, 8 interior, 9 keyhole, a glint | lantern: 1 outline, 2/4/5 gold frame, 3/6/7 glow, 8-9 dark glass
#   icons: 1 outline, 2/4/5 main ramp, 3/6 light material ramp

pal chest         #200C04 #B86830 #F8C840 #E89C58 #7A3818 #FFF4B0 #C08020 #401808 #100404 #FFFFFF
pal toad.head     #200810 #FFFFFF #F0F0F8 #C0C8E0 #8088B0 #FF9888 #E83838 #B01828 #681018
pal toad.body     #200810 #FFE8C8 #F8C090 #C88050 #88A8FF #3858D8 #2038A0 #101C60 #FFFFF0 #F0E0B0 #C0A878 #B86830 #7A3C18 #401808 #FFFFFF
pal princess.head #200810 #FFF4B0 #F8C838 #D09020 #905010 #FFE8D0 #F8C8A0 #D09070 #F04860
pal princess.body #200810 #FFF4B0 #F8C838 #D09020 #905010 #FFE8D0 #F8C8A0 #D09070 #F8D048 #FFD0E8 #F890B8 #D05088 #902858
pal lantern       #180C04 #E0A030 #FFE070 #FFF0B0 #905010 #FFFFF0 #F8A030 #302838 #9090B8
pal lantern.glow  #180C04 #E0A030 #FFF0A0 #FFF0B0 #905010 #FFFFFF #FFC848 #302838 #9090B8
pal icon.pwing    #200810 #E03028 #F8F8F8 #F88878 #901018 #C8C8E0
pal icon.tanooki  #201008 #B06830 #F8E0B0 #E0A060 #703818 #D0A870
pal icon.frog     #081808 #40B040 #F8F8E0 #98E878 #187018 #C8D8A0
pal icon.hammer   #101018 #686880 #F8F8F8 #A8A8C8 #383848 #C8D0E8
pal icon.cloud    #202858 #9898D8 #FFFFFF #C8C8F8 #6060A8 #D8E0F8

